<title>USA: Annualised U.S. aluminum output falls in May.</title>
<headline>Annualised U.S. aluminum output falls in May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. primary aluminum output on an annualized basis fell in May to a rate of 3,583,994 tonnes compared with 3,594,995 tonnes in April, Aluminum Association reported.</p>
<p>The annual rate of production in May 1996 was 3,578,051 tonnes.</p>
<p>The average daily rate of production in May was 9,819 tonnes compared with 9,849 tonnes in April.</p>
<p>Actual production in May was 304,394 tonnes.</p>
<p>Production January through May was 1,489,636 tonnes.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
